{
  "_comment": [
    "Topology AI (BR-A3). Bon hang doi TACH BIET voi consumer pool rieng.",
    "Ly do tach: mot job bao cao chay 2 phut khong duoc phep lam khach trong",
    "phong cho phai cho them 2 phut cho cau tra loi cua minh.",
    "",
    "NGUON CHUAN la code: libs/go/mq/topology.go (AITopology). File nay phai khop;",
    "unit test libs/go/mq doi chieu tung exchange/queue/binding/arguments.",
    "",
    "Giao thuc retry (do consumer dieu khien, header x-ef-attempt bat dau tu 1):",
    "- Loi lan n < 3: publish ban sao (x-ef-attempt = n+1) vao ai.retry voi key = ten",
    "  cong viec -> ai.<job>.retry (hang cho rieng cho tung cong viec: chat 5s,",
    "  moderation 30s, anomaly 30s, report 2m). Het TTL, hang cho dead-letter ve",
    "  ai.direct voi x-dead-letter-routing-key = chinh ten cong viec -> quay lai",
    "  ai.<job>.q. Hang cho dung quorum at-least-once + reject-publish.",
    "- Loi lan 3 hoac loi vinh vien: publish vao ai.dlx voi key = ten cong viec;",
    "  ai.dlq bind tung key (exchange direct, KHONG dung wildcard #).",
    "- Hang goc ai.<job>.q KHONG co x-dead-letter-* va khong co x-max-priority",
    "  (quorum queue khong ho tro priority).",
    "",
    "x-message-ttl cua ai.chat.q la 60s va la CO Y: cau tra loi den sau khi",
    "khach da duoc admit vao mua ve thi khong con gia tri gi. Het TTL thi message",
    "bi BO, khong di retry.",
    "",
    "Su kien nghiep vu (payment.events, ticketing.events -- exchange topic):",
    "- Moi exchange co hang <exchange>.sink.q bind '#', giu 1000 ban moi nhat.",
    "  Publisher bat mandatory; khong co sink thi mot routing key chua co consumer",
    "  bi broker tra ve va relay outbox (dung o dong loi dau tien) ket vinh vien.",
    "- Consumer co retry theo mau AI nhung hang tre dead-letter ve default",
    "  exchange voi key = ten hang goc, nen message khong lap sang consumer khac.",
    "  Routing key goc giu trong header x-ef-routing-key.",
    "  ticketing.order-paid.q: order.paid -> phat ve (retry 5s).",
    "  notification.events.q: order.paid, payment.refunded, ticketing.ticket.issued",
    "  -> email/SMS (retry 10s)."
  ],
